% A head pattern variable named X_0 must not shadow the slot holding the
% active constraint's first argument. It did, so the guard read the
% extracted constant instead of A. The slot names are reserved now.
:- module(hnf_arg_slot_shadow, [go/1]).

:- chr_type t ---> f(any).

:- chr_constraint c/2, out/1, ask/1, go/1.

c(A, f(X_0)) ==> A > 0 | out(A).

out(A) \ ask(R) <=> R = A.

go(R) <=> c(5, f(0)), ask(R).
